2998678996037\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"211.2998678996037\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"60.61095022624434,327.6470588235294 96.02051948051948,296.9090909090909 160.12900000000002,254.60000000000002 260.252,207.28 336.3557894736842,176.05263157894737 405.1684210526316,67.49122807017545\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 1%&amp;#10;It rained 15% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 221 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"60.61095022624434\" cy=\"327.6470588235294\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 11%&amp;#10;It rained 23% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 77 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"96.02051948051948\" cy=\"296.9090909090909\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 29%&amp;#10;It rained 35% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 80 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"160.12900000000002\" cy=\"254.60000000000002\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 57%&amp;#10;It rained 48% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 75 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"260.252\" cy=\"207.28\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 79%&amp;#10;It rained 57% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 76 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"336.3557894736842\" cy=\"176.05263157894737\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 98%&amp;#10;It rained 86% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 228 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"405.1684210526316\" cy=\"67.49122807017545\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(47%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Leicester the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>winter</b> (0.29) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (0.17).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>37%</td><td class='num'>0.171</td><td class='num'>13.2%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>57%</td><td class='num'>0.172</td><td class='num'>16.6%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>218</td><td class='num'>30%</td><td class='num'>0.188</td><td class='num'>12.0%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>175</td><td class='num'>67%</td><td class='num'>0.290</td><td class='num'>11.0%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":52.6386,"lon":-1.13169,"n":757,"n_cities":213,"name":"Leicester","offset_days":0,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.06,"lo":0.0,"mean":0.007375565610859728,"n":221,"obs":0.1493212669683258,"sig":true},{"hi":0.2,"lo":0.06,"mean":0.1074025974025974,"n":77,"obs":0.23376623376623376,"sig":true},{"hi":0.44,"lo":0.2,"mean":0.28850000000000003,"n":80